{
  "_note": "Run: python3 bin/mutate.py --spec mutations/step3-plan.json (pure stdlib, no venv needed). Proves the Step-3 plan guards in tests/test_step3_plan.py are not vacuous: a lying checkbox, a mispointed `next`, a bumped ceiling, a new out-of-order port, a dropped/overlapping partition entry, and a duplicate order are each caught. The mutations edit the machine-readable JSON block in docs/STEP3_PORTING_PLAN.md.",
